{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackwood, a remote 17th-century village, hides more than cobblestone streets and polite smiles. When Henry Burns bursts into flames under mysterious circumstances, suspicion falls on a so-called witch. You are Brian Storm, a detective hunting the truth in a village hunting a witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/327cfc6e0510db11cd738512c984466f.poster.avif?t=1768313956\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/327cfc6e0510db11cd738512c984466f.webm?t=1768313956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/327cfc6e0510db11cd738512c984466f.mp4?t=1768313956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is pure detective work. Interrogate villagers, examine locations for physical evidence, and piece together the evidence in a revolutionary deduction system. In a sea of clues, only the right pieces fit together-meaningless on their own, but revealing the truth once combined. Over 50 unique deductions await, each shaping the course of your investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/67231e08e105d0d6f593b39f590875f4.poster.avif?t=1768313956\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/67231e08e105d0d6f593b39f590875f4.webm?t=1768313956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/67231e08e105d0d6f593b39f590875f4.mp4?t=1768313956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every villager is a piece of the puzzle. Blackwood\u2019s residents are a colorful, memorable cast, each harboring secrets that may help or hinder your search. Some truths will shock you. Others will make you question your own judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/91d70f189b1d7473495a015bb1b85af9.poster.avif?t=1768313956\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/91d70f189b1d7473495a015bb1b85af9.webm?t=1768313956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/91d70f189b1d7473495a015bb1b85af9.mp4?t=1768313956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a grim yet witty 17th-century setting, where the atmosphere is thick with mistrust, whispers, and the occasional dark chuckle. Explore freely, follow your own leads, and peel back the layers of deception at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/78cb31bafa435250434d17121f566ede.poster.avif?t=1768313956\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/78cb31bafa435250434d17121f566ede.webm?t=1768313956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/extras/78cb31bafa435250434d17121f566ede.mp4?t=1768313956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure story-driven investigation-every step built on the clues you uncover. Just you, your mind, and a village full of lies. Can you uncover the truth before another innocent is lost to the fire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note on voice acting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on player feedback, we plan to add voice acting to the dialogues in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, this feature is not included in the demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947990?t=1768313956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947990?t=1768313956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/399d6e299b432f60f6e21827925dab4434b0f1df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768313956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990/399d6e299b432f60f6e21827925dab4434b0f1df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768313956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4052130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackwood, a remote 17th-century village, hides more than cobblestone streets and polite smiles. When Henry Burns bursts into flames under mysterious circumstances, suspicion falls on a so-called witch. You are Brian Storm, a detective hunting the truth in a village hunting a witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947990